#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:67 imageplugin_restoration.cpp:62
msgid "Photograph Restoration"
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:69
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to restore a photograph."
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ रिस्टोर गर्ने डिजिक्यान छवि प्लगइन ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:75
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "लेखक र सम्भारकर्ता"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:78
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "CImg लाइब्रेरी"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:81
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "फिडब्याक र प्लगइन पोलिसिङ"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:92
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "प्रिसेट"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:100
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "CImg लाइब्रेरी वेबसाइट अवलोकन गर्नुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:102
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "फिल्टरिङ्ग प्रकार:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:104
msgid "None"
msgstr "कुनै पनि होइन"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:105
msgid "Reduce Uniform Noise"
msgstr "एउटै प्रकारको आवाज घटाउनुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:106
msgid "Reduce JPEG Artefacts"
msgstr "जेपीईजी शिल्पकृति घटाउनुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:107
msgid "Reduce Texturing"
msgstr "मिलावट घटाउनुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph "
"restoration:<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to "
"default.<p><b>Reduce Uniform Noise</b>: reduce small image artifacts like "
"sensor noise.<p><b>Reduce JPEG Artefacts</b>: reduce large image artifacts "
"like JPEG compression mosaic.<p><b>Reduce Texturing</b>: reduce image "
"artifacts like paper texture or Moire patterns of a scanned image.<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्तिका लागि प्रयोग गर्न यहाँ फिल्टर प्रिसेट चयन "
"गर्नुहोस्:<p><b>कुनै पनि होइन</b>: सबैभन्दा साझा मान । सेटिङलाई "
"पूर्वनिर्धारितमा राख्दछ ।<p><b>समान आवाज घटाउनुहोस्</b>: आवाज सचेतक जस्तै साना छवि शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस् ।<p><b>जेपीईजी शिल्पकृति घटाउनुहोस्</b>: जेपीईजी सङ्कुचन मोसेइक जस्तै छवि शिल्पकृति घटाउनुहोस् ।<p><b>मिलावट घटाउनुहोस्</b>: स्क्यान गरिएका छविको कागज मिलावट वा मोइर बान्की जस्तै छवि शिल्पकृति घटाउनुहोस् ।<p>"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:124
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "महीन"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:126
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "विवरण सुरक्षा:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:130
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features "
"in the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr "<p>लक्षित छविमा साना सुविधाका राम्रोपन स्तर सेट गर्ने विवरणको सुरक्षा । उच्च मानले विवरण राम्रो बनाएर छोड्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:136
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "एनिसोट्रोपी:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr "<p>विवरणका एनिसोट्रोपिक (दिशासूचक) परिमार्जक । गाउसियन आवाजका लागि यसलाई सानो राख्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:144
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "महीन:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr "<p>पूर्ण महीन सामर्थ्य: यदि विवरण कारकले सापेक्षिक महीन र ग्रेडिएन्ट कारक दिशा सेट गर्छ भने, समय चरणले सम्पूर्ण प्रभाव सेट गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:153
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "नियमितता:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:157
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not "
"use a high value here, or the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>यो मानले लक्षित छविको महीन नियमितता नियन्त्रण गर्दछ । यहाँ उच्च मान "
"प्रयोग नगर्नुहोस्, नत्र लक्षित छवि पूर्ण रुपमा अस्पष्ट हुनेछ ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:163
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "पुनरावृत्ति:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:167
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>लक्षित छविमा फिल्टर लागू गरिएको सङ्ख्या सेट गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:175
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "उन्नत सेटिङ"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:177
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "कोणीय चरण:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:181
msgid "<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr "<p>एनिस्ट्रोपीको समानताको कोणीय सम्मिलन चरण यहाँ डिग्रीमा सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:185
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "पूरा चरण:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:189
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>अबकाशिक पूरा चरण यहाँ सेट गर्नुहोस् । १ तल रहनुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:193
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "गाउसियन:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:197
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>गउसियन प्रकार्यको सूक्ष्मता यहाँ सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:201
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "रेखीय इन्टरपोलेसन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:202
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr "<p>गुणको अन्तिम बिट (बिस्तारै) नष्ट गर्न यो विकल्प सक्षम पार्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:205
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "सामान्यकृत फोटोग्राफ"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:206
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>निर्गत छवि सामान्यकरण प्रक्रिया गर्न यो विकल्प सक्षम पार्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:394
msgid "Restoration"
msgstr "पुन: प्राप्ति"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:402
msgid "Photograph Restoration Settings File to Load"
msgstr "लोड गर्ने फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति सेटिङ"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:415
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Restoration settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति सेटिङ पाठ फाइल होइन ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:437
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Restoration text file."
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति पाठ फाइलबाट सेटिङ लोड गर्न सकिँदैन ।"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:446
msgid "Photograph Restoration Settings File to Save"
msgstr "बचत गर्ने फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति सेटिङ फाइल"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:468
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Restoration text file."
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति पाठ फाइलमा सेटिङ बचत गर्न सकिँदैन ।"

#: imageplugin_restoration.cpp:42
msgid "Restoration..."
msgstr "पुन: प्राप्ति..."

